01:00:13.500 --> 01:00:21.300
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss, Torey Malatia, who really wishes we hadn't aired that story about him a couple weeks ago.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督我们节目的是我们的老板，托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia），他真心希望我们几周前没播出那个关于他的故事。

01:00:21.300 --> 01:00:28.350
<v Robyn Forest>Yeah, no, I was like, "I told you guys that we shouldn't try to make this into a story. And now look. I'm a lesbian in Japan."
<v Robyn Forest>是的，没有，我当时就像，“我告诉过你们，我们不应该尝试把它写成专题。现在好了，我在日本成了同性恋。”

01:00:28.350 --> 01:00:33.350
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week, with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周回来，带着《美国生活》的更多故事。
